      *  Validation gates (tests/lint/)
      *  ------------------------------
      *  This file is designed to pass all four lint gates:
      *    * check_no_business_logic.sh -- contains zero arithmetic
      *      verbs (COMPUTE / MULTIPLY / DIVIDE / ADD / SUBTRACT)
      *      anywhere outside BEFORE-EACH/AFTER-EACH.  All MOVEs in
      *      testcase preludes are alphanumeric-literal or numeric-
